{
  "slug": "tofu-black-bean-breakfast-hash",
  "name": "Tofu and black bean breakfast hash",
  "description": "Crumbled firm tofu browned with diced potato, mushrooms and peppers, finished with black beans and chili powder for a savoury high-protein start.",
  "iconKey": "bowl_dash",
  "instructions": [
    "Dice the potato small and cook it in the olive oil in a wide nonstick pan over medium-high heat until the edges brown, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add the onion, bell pepper and mushrooms and cook for 4 minutes, until they soften and release their liquid.",
    "Crumble in the tofu, scatter over the chili powder and salt, and cook for 3 minutes, stirring once, so the tofu takes on colour.",
    "Stir through the black beans and cook for 2 minutes more, until heated through.",
    "Divide between two warm plates and serve straight away."
  ],
